      "explanation": "The doctor assessed and followed bleeding, fever, abdominal pain, odor, and leg symptoms, but did not fully cover all required post-induction danger symptoms such as suspected fluid leakage and dizziness/syncope thresholds despite the patient reporting weakness/headiness. This is an incomplete but not grossly unsafe red-flag chain.",
