          "quote": "千万不要自己加回去"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "The doctor discussed thyroid reassessment but not clear current thyroid-medication continuation rules.",
          "quote": "医生可能会开一点很安全的甲状腺素片"
        }
