      "explanation": "Aspirin/heparin safety was handled well, but the doctor did not specifically address prior保胎药 such as progesterone/dydrogesterone/femoston and did not clearly distinguish current thyroid medication as not to be stopped or changed without the prescribing doctor. This leaves a moderate medication-execution gap without an affirmative dangerous instruction.",
